(5) R CROSSING per cell. R(W) = sum_i w_i (F_i + c_i + sigma_i + q l_i + S_i) / sum_i w_i T_i over LATE
    window medians, w = dlv, S = T - Tmin, c_i = 1/2 max(0, max_j F_j - F_i); q = 0.10 (Bulk).
    "session": F per leg = median of the estimator over the cell small-pool rows (K = 8; E1 also K = 4).
    "own": each row its own boot estimate (what a static pool latches). Crossing = first W where median R < 1.
